{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30237","headline":"题劒门先寄上西蜀杜司徒 · 薛逢","name":"题劒门先寄上西蜀杜司徒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峭壁横空限一隅，划开元气建洪枢。\n梯航百货通邦计，键闭诸蛮屏帝都。\n西蹙犬戎威北狄，南吞荆郢制东吴。\n千年管钥谁熔范，只自先天造化炉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}